Package: ADAPT
Title: Tool Collection For Consistent IDI Projects
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Simon", "Anastasiadis", , "simon.anastasiadis@sia.govt.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Accelerated Data Analysis & Pipeline Toolkit (ADAPT) is a
 collection of tools for standardised activities that are part of conducting
 research in the IDI (Integrated Data Infrastructure). These include the
 assembly of a master table from many source tables, producing consistent
 summaries, and applying confidentialisation rules. While designed for IDI
 environment, this package may also be useful for analytic projects outside
 the IDI environment. ADAPT has been built to use dbplyr so it can operate on
 both data stored in databases and data loaded into R memory.
